{
  "about": "Commit script for the Initech sample repo. build_demo.py replays it, oldest first, into a temporary git repo so the real generator reads real history. Paths are the names at the time of the commit. Dates are days before the build, so the New and Updated tabs always look current. Files not added by a later commit arrive in the first commits: an import commit takes those under its folders, and the initial commit takes the rest.",
